//www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-qr-code\"><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"16\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"5\" x=\"3\" y=\"16\" rx=\"1\"></rect><path d=\"M21 16h-3a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v3\"></path><path d=\"M21 21v.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 7v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 3h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 16v.01\"></path><path d=\"M16 12h1\"></path><path d=\"M21 12v.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 21v-1\"></path></svg>QR Code Generator</a></nav><div class=\"sidebar-bottom\"><span class=\"small-mark\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg></span><p>A little less effort.<br/><strong>A lot more done.</strong></p><span class=\"version\">Toolbox / v1.0</span></div></aside><div class=\"main-shell\"><header class=\"header\"><div class=\"breadcrumb\"><span>Workspace</span><span class=\"slash\">/</span><span>All tools</span></div><div class=\"header-right\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"command-trigger\" aria-label=\"Open command palette\" title=\"Find any tool (Ctrl K)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><kbd>Ctrl K</kbd></button><span class=\"header-note\">Small tools. Everyday useful.</span><button class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark theme\" title=\"Switch to dark theme\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-moon\"><path d=\"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main id=\"main\"><div class=\"page-transition\"><div class=\"page home-page\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span> YOUR EVERYDAY TOOLKIT</div><h1>Less friction.<br/><span>More getting things done.</span></h1><p class=\"intro\">Handy tools for the little things that fill your day.<br class=\"desktop-break\"/> All in one place, ready when you are.</p><div class=\"section-heading\"><h2>All tools <span class=\"badge\">8</span></h2><span>A growing collection of useful things</span></div><div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-panel border border-border bg-panel px-4 py-3 text-dim\"><label class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Search tools</span><input type=\"search\" class=\"w-full min-w-0 bg-panel text-text outline-none\" placeholder=\"Search tools, calculators, images…\" value=\"\"/></label><button type=\"button\" class=\"command-trigger\" aria-label=\"Open command palette\" title=\"Find any tool (Ctrl K)\"><kbd>Ctrl K</kbd></button></div><div class=\"tool-grid\"><div data-grid-id=\"word-generator\" class=\"animated-grid-item\"><a class=\"tool-card\" href=\"/tools/word-generator\"><div class=\"card-top\"><span class=\"tool-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shuffle\"><path d=\"m18 14 4 4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"m18 2 4 4-4 4\"></path><path d=\"M2 18h1.973a4 4 0 0 0 3.3-1.7l5.454-8.6a4 4 0 0 1 3.3-1.7H22\"></path><path d=\"M2 6h1.972a4 4 0 0 1 3.6 2.2\"></path><path d=\"M22 18h-6.041a4 4 0 0 1-3.3-1.8l-.359-.45\"></path></svg></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right card-arrow\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"category\">Language</span><h3>Word Generator</h3><p>Discover a random English or Nepali word with one tap. Two independent word collections.</p><div class=\"card-bottom\"><span>Open tool <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"availability\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>Ready to use</span></div></a></div><div data-grid-id=\"calculators\" class=\"animated-grid-item\"><a class=\"tool-card\" href=\"/tools/calculators\"><div class=\"card-top\"><span class=\"tool-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-calculator\"><rect width=\"16\" height=\"20\" x=\"4\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"8\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"16\" x2=\"16\" y1=\"14\" y2=\"18\"></line><path d=\"M16 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 10h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 14h.01\"></path><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path><path d=\"M8 18h.01\"></path></svg></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right card-arrow\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"category\">Utilities</span><h3>Calculators</h3><p>From quick arithmetic to money, grades, health, and dates. Find the right calculator for your question.</p><div class=\"card-bottom\"><span>Open tool <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"availability\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>Ready to use</span></div></a></div><div data-grid-id=\"nepali-typing\" class=\"animated-grid-item\"><a class=\"tool-card\" href=\"/tools/nepali-typing\"><div class=\"card-top\"><span class=\"tool-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-languages\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6\"></path><path d=\"m4 14 6-6 2-3\"></path><path d=\"M2 5h12\"></path><path d=\"M7 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m22 22-5-10-5 10\"></path><path d=\"M14 18h6\"></path></svg></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right card-arrow\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"category\">Language</span><h3>Nepali Typing</h3><p>Write Nepali using English letters. Choose spellings, copy your text, and keep a private draft.</p><div class=\"card-bottom\"><span>Open tool <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"availability\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>Ready to use</span></div></a></div><div data-grid-id=\"preeti-to-unicode\" class=\"animated-grid-item\"><a class=\"tool-card\" href=\"/tools/preeti-to-unicode\"><div class=\"card-top\"><span class=\"tool-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-type\"><polyline points=\"4 7 4 4 20 4 20 7\"></polyline><line x1=\"9\" x2=\"15\" y1=\"20\" y2=\"20\"></line><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"4\" y2=\"20\"></line></svg></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right card-arrow\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"category\">Language</span><h3>Preeti to Unicode</h3><p>Turn legacy Preeti text into Unicode Nepali. Copy, convert, and download privately in your browser.</p><div class=\"card-bottom\"><span>Open tool <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"availability\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>Ready to use</span></div></a></div><div data-grid-id=\"speed-test\" class=\"animated-grid-item\"><a class=\"tool-card\" href=\"/tools/speed-test\"><div class=\"card-top\"><span class=\"tool-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gauge\"><path d=\"m12 14 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0\"></path></svg></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right card-arrow\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"category\">Network</span><h3>Speed test</h3><p>Get a clear picture of your connection. Check your download, upload, and ping in seconds.</p><div class=\"card-bottom\"><span>Open tool <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"availability\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>Ready to use</span></div></a></div><div data-grid-id=\"photo-compressor\" class=\"animated-grid-item\"><a class=\"tool-card\" href=\"/tools/photo-compressor\"><div class=\"card-top\"><span class=\"tool-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-image-down\"><path d=\"M10.3 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v10l-3.1-3.1a2 2 0 0 0-2.814.014L6 21\"></path><path d=\"m14 19 3 3v-5.5\"></path><path d=\"m17 22 3-3\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"9\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"21\" height=\"21\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right card-arrow\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"category\">Images</span><h3>Photo Compressor</h3><p>Make images smaller with a target file size. Preview the result before you download.</p><div class=\"card-bottom\"><span>Open tool <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"availability\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span>Ready to use</span></div></a></div><div data-grid-id=\"date-converter\" class=\"animated-grid-item\"><a class=\"tool-card\" href=\"/tools/date-converter\"><div class=\"card-top\"><span class=\"tool-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-